WEBVTT

00:00:00.580 --> 00:00:05.300
Hi, I'm Tilly! You can script tuios from any shell.

00:00:06.572 --> 00:00:09.372
Set config changes any option in the running session.

00:00:09.856 --> 00:00:12.736
Subscribe prints each event as a line of JSON.

00:00:13.226 --> 00:00:16.266
Wait for blocks until a pane prints what you're waiting for.

00:00:19.290 --> 00:00:23.370
Themes work too. All 156 options change live.

00:00:24.979 --> 00:00:27.619
Want to try it? The install guide is right here.
